{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Torsion.JetProlongation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Torsion.JetProlongation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Category"],"declarations":18,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.jet_prolongation_C","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.jet_prolongation_C","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/JetProlongation.lean#L59-L82","doc":"**ℂ jet prolongation preserves CR dimension.**\nLaTeX: `\\label{cor:jet-prolongation-C}`\n\n**Definitional, not derived — accessor for a defining field (2026-09-02).**\nThis was labelled *\"Corollary\"*, which oversells it: `prolonged` and `base`\nare independent `CQuantumObservableUniverse` fields of\n`JetProlongationQOU`, so nothing forces their `n` to agree **except**\n`dim_preserved`, which this returns verbatim. There is no derivation here\nand none is possible from the other fields.\n\nThat is not a defect. `JetProlongationQOU` *defines* an object — a jet\nprolongation of a ℂ QOU — and `dim_preserved` is one of its defining\nconditions, so this is Mathlib's `Group.mul_assoc := Group.mul_assoc`\nidiom: an accessor exposing an axiom of the definition under a readable\nname. Compare `QOU.Mass.CoordinationBinding.binding_eq_bond_energy`, the\nsame shape, whose docstring already says *\"just `h.extensive`, exposed as\na named consumer\"*.\n\nWhat was wrong was only the word. A reader who sees \"Corollary\" expects\nthe statement to follow from something; here it *is* the something. Bean\n`qou-z9ws`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:cor:jet-prolongation-C","label":"cor:jet-prolongation-C","md":"quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/jet-prolongation-C.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.JetProlongationQOU.connection_unique","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.JetProlongationQOU.connection_unique","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/JetProlongation.lean#L56-L56","doc":"The prolonged connection is uniquely determined. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.JetProlongationQOU.dim_preserved","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.JetProlongationQOU.dim_preserved","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/JetProlongation.lean#L54-L54","doc":"CR dimension is preserved. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.JetProlongationQOU.prolongedInst","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.JetProlongationQOU.prolongedInst","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/JetProlongation.lean#L52-L52","doc":"The prolonged instanton connection. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.JetProlongationQOU.prolonged","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.JetProlongationQOU.prolonged","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/JetProlongation.lean#L50-L50","doc":"The prolonged ℂ quantum observable universe. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.JetProlongationQOU.inst","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.JetProlongationQOU.inst","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/JetProlongation.lean#L48-L48","doc":"The instanton connection on the base. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.JetProlongationQOU.base","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.JetProlongationQOU.base","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/JetProlongation.lean#L46-L46","doc":"The base ℂ quantum observable universe. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.JetProlongationQOU.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.JetProlongationQOU.mk","kind":"ctor","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/JetProlongation.lean#L44-L44","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.JetProlongationQOU","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.JetProlongationQOU","kind":"structure","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/JetProlongation.lean#L42-L57","doc":"**Proposition (Jet Prolongation).**\nLaTeX: `\\label{prop:jet-prolongation}` ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.JetProlongation.restriction_preserves_comul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.JetProlongation.restriction_preserves_comul","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/JetProlongation.lean#L39-L39","doc":"Restriction preserves comultiplication. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.JetProlongation.ascent_preserves_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.JetProlongation.ascent_preserves_mul","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/JetProlongation.lean#L36-L36","doc":"Ascent preserves multiplication. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.JetProlongation.retraction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.JetProlongation.retraction","kind":"theorem","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/JetProlongation.lean#L34-L34","doc":"`r ∘ ℓ = id_A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.JetProlongation.restriction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.JetProlongation.restriction","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/JetProlongation.lean#L32-L32","doc":"The restriction map `r : J¹(A) → A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.JetProlongation.ascent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.JetProlongation.ascent","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/JetProlongation.lean#L30-L30","doc":"The ascent embedding `ℓ : A ↪ J¹(A)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.JetProlongation.jet","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.JetProlongation.jet","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/JetProlongation.lean#L28-L28","doc":"The jet Frobenius–Hopf object `J¹(A)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.JetProlongation.base","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.JetProlongation.base","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/JetProlongation.lean#L26-L26","doc":"The base Frobenius–Hopf object `A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.JetProlongation.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.JetProlongation.mk","kind":"ctor","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/JetProlongation.lean#L23-L23","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.JetProlongation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.JetProlongation","kind":"structure","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/JetProlongation.lean#L21-L40","doc":"**Jet prolongation data**: the categorical jet object `J¹(A) = A ⊗ Ω¹(A)`.\nLaTeX: `\\label{prop:jet-prolongation}`, Steps 1–2. ","signatureChunk":0}]}